  <item>
    <title>#06：今天，我是一朵花</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64b7915832fb5cf4c95bc68d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64b7915832fb5cf4c95bc68d</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Jul 2023 07:31:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>这期纯天然无剪辑。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>时隔几月，依旧夏天。本期嘉宾仍然是我们的十一老师，今天的内容一共分为以下三个话题，围绕查理·芒格的《芒格之道》切入，最后十一老师给大家送上了诗和彩蛋~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Show Note:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>1：做饭是简单的</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>生态，模式等是复杂的</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>昨天我学会了煮饺子</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>今天我又学会了煮粥</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>身体知道，这些是简单的</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>我学会了，满心欢喜，连睡觉都是安心的</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>借贷要考虑杠杠和清算</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>交易要考虑滑点和深度</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>身体知道，这些是很难的</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>学得很累，焦虑，深夜起来皱眉</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>生态、协议、模型</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>这些就太难了</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>我看见有人侃侃而谈</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>希望他们面对考验</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>不会爆仓、不被清算</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>我现在会煮饺子</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>感觉幸福</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>我握着一把青菜</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>感觉踏实</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>可能这就是现货吧</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>我不想知道更多的东西</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>此刻，允许自己做一个简单的人</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>当火点燃的时候</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>我不会爆仓</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>2：回到简单</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>一个项目能不能参与、鉴别真假信息……这些都是复杂，回到简单，简单到煮饺子，这样就回到自己。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>3：爱是现货，现货是当下与此刻。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>比如一朵花</span></p><span></span><p><span>不要愿景、叙事，要石头、花、树叶。</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>亲爱的</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>当别人给你梦想、愿景和叙事的时候</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>我要给你花、树叶和石头</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>请不要嫌弃这些微小的</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>我给不了你宏大的，它们永远与我无关</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>身体里也没有它们</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>花是我认真选过的</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>树叶是我跳起来摘下的</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>石头是我日日夜夜收藏着的</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>今天，我要把这些送给你</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>我想上帝和我一样</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>爱着花、照顾着树叶、抚摸着石头</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>此刻，你也要感受它们</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>真真切切，踏踏实实</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>至于梦想、愿景和叙事</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>天堂里没有它们的位置</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>我不会骗你</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luGmgGPHsDz7zK99E7Kj4-xsEfLy.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>以下，Enjoy~</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhRCjbm7bz6rjHPeKEeycyBXCiOB.m4a" length="36587063" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:37:26</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnHrVAev8V0UlHHq07FbftJYgU3j.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>#05十一：我是一颗桃树</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64757fe916726282406e8c81</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64757fe916726282406e8c81</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 30 May 2023 04:47:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>这期纯天然未剪辑！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>半年后，我和十一老师在一个悠闲&amp;阳光的下午约上一壶好茶，与大家见面~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>以一首代表本期主题的小诗进入今天的Show Notes：</span></strong></p><span></span><h2><em><span>我一直喜欢花草、柳树和春天</span></em></h2><span></span><h2><em><span>诚实的、认真的、默默的</span></em></h2><span></span><h2><em><span>生长着也存在着</span></em></h2><span></span><h2><em><span>神住在花蕊上，也住在树叶里</span></em></h2><span></span><h2><em><span>住在春风中，也住在小草边</span></em></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><em><span>之前我总是摇晃着</span></em></h2><span></span><h2><em><span>从来不曾停下来观察自己，观察万物</span></em></h2><span></span><h2><em><span>今天，我拒绝了热闹的地方</span></em></h2><span></span><h2><em><span>在做出决定的一瞬间，神也住进我心里</span></em></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><em><span>我站在小河边吹着风</span></em></h2><span></span><h2><em><span>和花草、柳树和春天做了朋友</span></em></h2><span></span><h2><em><span>外面是不应该羡慕的</span></em></h2><span></span><h2><em><span>远方是不值得向往的</span></em></h2><span></span><h2><em><span>此时此刻，我不住，也不盼</span></em></h2><span></span><h2><em><span>如是的，如在的，如一切本来的</span></em></h2><span></span><h2><span>↓当天交谈时的天气和环境~</span></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lp-dDXb6b14rMAGZzUfNprI_rtm7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>敲黑板：这期真正的彩蛋不是推荐的书目，而是十一老师的私照~o(〃'▽'〃)o</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ls5wtdduxkBW8-BIjhVaFCx56DFJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>以下, Enjoy~</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhUQ_ZwKl0WezBi_-9aQJ3f27rxQ.m4a" length="57540571" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:50</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnHrVAev8V0UlHHq07FbftJYgU3j.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
